    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Combat Master: Battle to DEATH ! a casual soulslike game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game is:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combination of Vampire Survivors mechanics and Dark souls combat + mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls-like combat with 4 abilities. Usually a buff, 2 damaging skills and an ultimate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Souls-like combat?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1: Dodge rolling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2: Backstab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3: Parrying &amp; Riposte (only as a perk on samurai)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4: Stamina bar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5: Dynamic targeting or lock-on, the good ol white dot on target</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra combat related mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1: Sliding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2: Classic MMO inspired Abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience by killing mobs and on level up you get to upgrade your stats or gain new perks from a random selection. Each class is completely unique, from skills to weapons and perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both game modes spawn mobs endlessely. Try to survive as long as possible or win by killing a boss. Difficulty increases the further you get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636840/extras/416e6abc76aaa7c219010517c87722e8.poster.avif?t=1750110937\" width=576 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636840/extras/416e6abc76aaa7c219010517c87722e8.webm?t=1750110937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636840/extras/416e6abc76aaa7c219010517c87722e8.mp4?t=1750110937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features/Stuff:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- Level up system, perks &amp; stat upgrading</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- 6 Classes, each with their own unique abilities and upgrade paths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636840/extras/accee785ef3ff6785f4b198d82ec3dac.poster.avif?t=1750110937\" width=576 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636840/extras/accee785ef3ff6785f4b198d82ec3dac.webm?t=1750110937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636840/extras/accee785ef3ff6785f4b198d82ec3dac.mp4?t=1750110937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- 8 maps with each having their own enemies and bosses in it</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- Steam Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- Personal Stats (kills, steps stepped etc.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- Leaderboards for both total kills and boss kills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- 2 game modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 Campaign:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t\t\t\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Kill a boss that spawns at 5 minutes to win the match.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t\t\u00a0 \u00a0 Infinity:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t\t\t\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 No time limit, try to survive as long as possible.</strong></p>",
