o/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636840/extras/416e6abc76aaa7c219010517c87722e8.mp4?t=1750110937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features/Stuff:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- Level up system, perks &amp; stat upgrading</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- 6 Classes, each with their own unique abilities and upgrade paths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636840/extras/accee785ef3ff6785f4b198d82ec3dac.poster.avif?t=1750110937\" width=576 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636840/extras/accee785ef3ff6785f4b198d82ec3dac.webm?t=1750110937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636840/extras/accee785ef3ff6785f4b198d82ec3dac.mp4?t=1750110937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- 8 maps with each having their own enemies and bosses in it</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- Steam Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- Personal Stats (kills, steps stepped etc.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- Leaderboards for both total kills and boss kills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t- 2 game modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 Campaign:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t\t\t\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Kill a boss that spawns at 5 minutes to win the match.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t\t\u00a0 \u00a0 Infinity:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t\t\t\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 No time limit, try to survive as long as possible.</strong></p>",
